            "ethos_icon": "ethos-gentle",
            "ethos_label": "Made to be gentle on skin"
          }
        },
        "b_vetiver": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The one essential oil",
            "body": "<p>There is one essential oil in the range: <a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/vetiver-vetiveria-zizanioides-root-oil\">vetiver root oil</a>, from <em>Vetiveria zizanioides</em>, a natural essential oil distilled from the roots of the grass. We include it at a tenth of a percent, the same level in every product. Vetiver root oil is rich in antioxidant compounds, chiefly the vetivones, and it gives the blend its earthy note.</p><p>If your skin reacts easily, patch test on the inside of your forearm before first use, as with any new product.</p>",
            "caveat": "",
