        "b_base": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The base, and everything else",
            "body": "<p>Around those actives sits a supporting cast that does the quiet structural work: an olive-derived emulsifier system, olive-derived squalane, a gentle gluconolactone, glycerin, vitamin E and a few others. None of it is hidden. Every ingredient and its exact percentage is published on the product page, and each one has its own entry in the <a href=\"/blogs/ingredients\">ingredient library</a> if you want the detail and the sources.</p>",
