        "standfirst": "<p><em>The thinking behind what goes in, and what stays out.</em></p>",
        "intro": "<p>Every ingredient in a Biotaderm product has to do a job the published evidence supports, and every claim on the label has to be supported by that evidence.</p><p>We start with three kinds of ingredient chosen to work together, in a base made to be gentle. The last step is to adjust the finished formula to slightly acidic (pH 5 to 5.5), close to the pH of healthy skin.</p>",
